Package: plenka-gateway-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: adduser, cups, cups-client, libc6 (>= 2.36), libstdc++6
Maintainer: PlenkaCover release engineering
Description: PlenkaCover outbound-only industrial post gateway
 Connects one Ubuntu machine post to its local Massa-K scale and MERTECH printer.
 The browser-owned HID scanner and operator session remain separate from the agent credential.
